#===============================================================
# spec-kit
# GitHub Spec Kit local tooling
#
# Convention:
# - Spec Kit initialization files and agent skills are local tool state.
# - Collaborative specification and planning documents should be written under docs/.

.specify/
.agents/
.claude/

# Common Spec Kit / agent runtime leftovers
specs/
.specify-*/
speckit-cache/
speckit-logs/
*.speckit.log

# Keep shared documentation artifacts versioned
#
# ⚠️ 不要在这里写 `!docs/` `!docs/**`：
#    1) 本文件没有任何一条规则会忽略 docs/，这个"兜底"本就是空操作；
#    2) 它会反向撤销 common 片段里的 *.log / *.local / *.zip 等规则对
#       docs/ 内文件的忽略，等于在 docs/ 下开了个后门。
#    docs/ 靠"不去忽略它"来保留即可，不需要显式取反。


